    Then I should see an error message "Invalid email or password"
    And I should remain on the login page

  Scenario: Account lockout after multiple failures
    Given I attempt to log in with invalid credentials 3 times
    When I attempt to log in with valid credentials
    Then I should see an error message "Account locked. Try again in 15 minutes"

